sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client / SimulationService
    participant Engine as SimulationEngine
    participant Lifecycle as SimulationLifecycle
    participant Coordinator as TickCoordinator
    participant World as World (Settlement)
    participant View as WorldView
    participant Pool as RegionWorkerPool (4 Threads)
    participant Workers as 4 RegionWorkers
    participant Migrator as MigrationCoordinator
    participant Applier as StateChangeApplier
    participant Stock as ResourceStock
    participant Crisis as CrisisManager
    participant Observer as ObserverAI
    participant Choice as ChoiceCoordinator
    participant Chapter as ChapterManager
    participant Bus as EventBus
    participant Narrator as Narrator
    participant AsyncRec as AsyncEventRecorder
    participant Clock as WorldClock

    Client->>Engine: tick()
    Engine->>Lifecycle: canExecuteTick()
    Lifecycle-->>Engine: true

    Engine->>Coordinator: executeTick()

    Note over Coordinator: Phase 1: Overlap Check & State Guard (AtomicBoolean)
    Note over Coordinator: Phase 2: Snapshot Creation
    Coordinator->>World: settlement state check
    Coordinator->>View: snapshot(world, currentTick, currentVersion)
    View-->>Coordinator: immutable WorldView

    Note over Coordinator: Phase 3: Parallel Regional Evaluation
    Coordinator->>Pool: invokeAll(4 RegionTasks, 5s timeout)
    par Region NORTH
        Pool->>Workers: evaluate(NORTH, WorldView, tick, rng)
        Workers-->>Pool: RegionResult (actions, claims, migrationRequests)
    and Region SOUTH
        Pool->>Workers: evaluate(SOUTH, WorldView, tick, rng)
        Workers-->>Pool: RegionResult
    and Region EAST
        Pool->>Workers: evaluate(EAST, WorldView, tick, rng)
        Workers-->>Pool: RegionResult
    and Region WEST
        Pool->>Workers: evaluate(WEST, WorldView, tick, rng)
        Workers-->>Pool: RegionResult
    end
    Pool-->>Coordinator: List<Future<RegionResult>>

    Note over Coordinator: Phase 4: Validate worker results & task futures

    Note over Coordinator: Phase 5: Deterministic Merge (Sole Writer)
    Note over Coordinator: 5a. Canonical Sort by RegionId (1..4) and SurvivorId
    Note over Coordinator: Assign global sequential event numbering

    Note over Coordinator: 5b. Resolve & execute validated migrations
    Coordinator->>Migrator: applyMigrations(allMigrationRequests)
    alt Migration Fails Validation
        Migrator-->>Coordinator: Rollback applied & throw RuntimeException
        Coordinator-->>Engine: TickResult (failed, unadvanced)
    else Migrations Applied Successfully
        Migrator-->>Coordinator: List<AppliedMigration>
        
        Note over Coordinator: 5c. Atomically apply survivor actions
        Coordinator->>Applier: applyBatch(proposalsToApply)
        alt Domain Mutation Throws
            Applier-->>Coordinator: Rollback survivors & throw RuntimeException
            Coordinator->>Migrator: rollbackMigrations(appliedMigrations)
            Coordinator-->>Engine: TickResult (failed, unadvanced)
        else Batch Applied Successfully
            Applier-->>Coordinator: mutations applied
            
            Note over Coordinator: 5d. Resolve resource claims against stock
            Coordinator->>Stock: consume(food, water, medicine)
            
            Note over Coordinator: 5e. Advance crises & apply effects
            Coordinator->>Crisis: advanceAll(settlement, stock)
            Crisis-->>Coordinator: List<CrisisEffect>
            Note over Coordinator: Apply need and vitality deltas

            Note over Coordinator: 5f. Apply queued Observer interventions
            Coordinator->>Observer: applyQueuedInterventions(settlement, currentTick)
            Note over Coordinator: Mutate target needs/trust & mark APPLIED

            Note over Coordinator: 5g. Apply queued Choice consequences
            Coordinator->>Choice: drainPendingConsequences()
            Note over Coordinator: Mutate target needs/morale & emit CONSEQUENCE_APPLIED

            Note over Coordinator: 5h. Evaluate chapter transitions
            Coordinator->>Chapter: evaluateTick(settlement, currentTick, shortage)
            Chapter-->>Coordinator: Optional<ChapterTransition>

            Note over Coordinator: Map ProposedEvents to canonical SimEvents
            Coordinator->>Bus: publish(canonicalEvents)
            par Fan-out to Subscribers
                Bus->>Narrator: onEvent(event)
                Narrator-->>Narrator: Generate StoryCaption (priority/anti-repetition)
            and Fan-out to Persistence
                Bus->>AsyncRec: onEvent(event)
                AsyncRec-->>AsyncRec: Enqueue to critical / minor queues
            end

            Note over Coordinator: Phase 6: Advance Time & Increment Version
            Coordinator->>Clock: advance()
            Coordinator-->>Engine: TickResult (success, advanced)
            Engine->>View: snapshot(world, newTick, newVersion)
            Engine-->>Engine: update latestSnapshot
        end
    end

    opt Pending Pause or ChoiceMoment Pause Boundary
        Note over Engine: ChoiceCoordinator.hasPendingPause() == true || PAUSE_REQUESTED
        Engine->>Lifecycle: transitionTo(PAUSED)
    end

    Engine-->>Client: TickResult
